      "message": "Hi @keithshort@chromium.org, \n\nI have seen this behavior on ocelot as well as on ptlrvp platform and based on that observation, I have uploaded this patch. I have seen that major platforms are using different path defined using \"CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CUSTOM_FAN_CONTROL\" config and similar handling is taken care there. But I have found this gap in generic implementation for fan handling.",
